⍝ 01 · Basics: arithmetic, right-to-left evaluation, variables
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/01-basics.apls
⍝ In scripts only ⎕← lines print.

⎕←'2×3+4 = ',⍕2×3+4          ⍝ right to left: 2×(3+4) = 14
⎕←'(2×3)+4 = ',⍕(2×3)+4      ⍝ parentheses change the order: 10

price←4.5
qty←3
⎕←'total: ',⍕price×qty

⎕←'whole arrays at once: ',⍕1 2 3+10 20 30
⎕←'squares: ',⍕(⍳10)*2
⎕←'mean of 3 1 4 1 5 9: ',⍕(+/3 1 4 1 5 9)÷6
